  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Nordic</strong> набор мебели для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong></a>, добавляет полностью функциональную мебель, включая, но не ограничиваясь: <strong>сундуки</strong>, <strong>ящики</strong>, <strong>кровати</strong>, <strong>стулья</strong> и многое другое!</p>\n<p>Дизайн этой мебели был сильно вдохновлён <strong>The Elder Scrolls Online</strong> и <strong>Skyrim</strong>.</p>\n<h3>Рецепты</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Для крафта <strong>Nordic Planks</strong>/<strong>Nordic Wool</strong> необходимо использовать <strong>#minecraft:planks</strong>/<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>.</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/stonecutter_planks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Для крафта блоков мебели <strong>Nordic</strong> необходимо поместить в <strong>Furniture Station</strong> <strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>, <strong>Nordic Planks</strong> и <strong>Nordic Wool</strong>.</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Присоединяйтесь к нам в <strong>Discord</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
